                  "value": {
                    "stringValue": "An **agent trace** is a record of an AI agent\u2019s execution: what it received, the steps it took, any tools it called, the results it got back, and its final response.\n\nFor example:\n\n1. User asks for the weather.\n2. Agent calls a weather tool.\n3. Tool returns the forecast.\n4. Agent answers the user.\n\nTraces help developers understand, debug, and evaluate an agent\u2019s behavior. Depending on the system, a trace may include timing and errors too; it doesn\u2019t necessarily include the agent\u2019s private reasoning."
                  }
